sequenceDiagram
  title Q2 Level 1 – Select Work Shifts
  actor E as Employee
  participant UC as «use case»<br/>SelectWorkShifts
  participant EF as «facade»<br/>EmployeeFacade
  participant DF as «facade»<br/>DepartmentFacade
  participant SF as «facade»<br/>SchedulingFacade

  Note over E,SF: Steps 1–2 – list upcoming shifts of the employee's department
  E->>UC: getUpcomingShifts(empId)
  activate UC
  UC->>EF: deptId = getEmployeeDepartment(empId)
  opt deptId exists
    UC->>DF: deptShiftIds = getDepartmentShifts(deptId)
    UC->>SF: shifts = getUpcomingShifts(deptShiftIds)
  end
  UC-->>E: shifts
  deactivate UC

  Note over E,SF: Steps 3–4 – command selectShifts
  E->>UC: selectShifts(empId, shiftIds)
  activate UC
  UC->>EF: deptId = getEmployeeDepartment(empId)
  opt deptId exists
    UC->>DF: deptShiftIds = getDepartmentShifts(deptId)
    UC->>SF: upcoming = areUpcoming(shiftIds)
    opt shiftIds ⊆ deptShiftIds and upcoming
      UC->>EF: addPreferredShifts(empId, shiftIds)
    end
  end
  deactivate UC
